{"id":"huntik:page:4859","page_id":4859,"title":"Cutrace","kind":"spell","namespace":0,"summary":"Cutrace is a basic spell used by the Blood Spiral and is comparable to the Hyperstride spell. This spell increases the caster's speed and agility, permitting quick escape, sudden strikes during combat, and an increased jump distance. The spell manifests itself as a purple to red aura surrounding the caster's legs.","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:S2E36_Spiral_Student_Cutrace.png","wikitext":"File:S2E36_Spiral_Student_Cutrace.png","links":[]},"aura":{"text":"Red","wikitext":"Red","links":[]},"class":{"text":"Mobility","wikitext":"Mobility","links":[]},"users":{"text":"Harrison Fears\nMarduk\nRassimov\nSilent Soldiers\nUnnamed Orphan 003","wikitext":"[[Harrison Fears]]<br>[[Marduk]]<br>[[Rassimov]] <br> [[Silent Soldiers]]<br>[[Unnamed Orphan 003]]","links":[{"target_title":"Harrison Fears","label":"Harrison Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4446","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Harrison_Fears","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4446"},{"target_title":"Marduk","label":"Marduk","target_id":"huntik:page:4648","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Marduk","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4648"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Silent Soldiers","label":"Silent Soldiers","target_id":"huntik:page:4383","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Silent_Soldiers","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4383"},{"target_title":"Unnamed Orphan 003","label":"Unnamed Orphan 003","target_id":"huntik:page:26423","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Orphan_003","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A26423"}]},"first":{"text":"\"The Divine Comedy\"","wikitext":"\"[[The Divine Comedy]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Div