:"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Divine_Comedy","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5040"}]}],"start":0,"end":243}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"[[Rassimov]] used this spell to charge at [[Dante Vale]] and later to jump up onto the footbridge in [[the Professor's castle]]. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}\n\nOne of [[Tantras]]' students, [[Unnamed Orphan 003]], used this spell to run across a canal in [[Venice, Italy]]. {{source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}\n\nMarduk used this spell outside the [[Fortress of Iron Will]] to chase [[Santiago]] up a cliff. {{source|The Spiral War}}\n\n{{Clear}}","text":"Rassimov used this spell to charge at Dante Vale and later to jump up onto the footbridge in the Professor's castle. [The Divine Comedy]\n\nOne of Tantras' students, Unnamed Orphan 003, used this spell to run across a canal in Venice, Italy. [Boys Will Be Seekers]\n\nMarduk used this spell outside the Fortress of Iron Will to chase Santiago up a cliff. [The Spiral War]"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Tranche-course\n|POR=Pé Veloz, Velocidade Cortante}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Mobility spells]]\n[[Category:Red-aura spells]]","text":"French: Tranche-course\nPortuguese: Pé Veloz, Velocidade Cortante"}],"full_text":"Cutrace is a basic spell used by the Blood Spiral and is comparable to the Hyperstride spell. This spell increases the caster's speed and agility, permitting quick escape, sudden strikes during combat, and an increased jump distance. The spell manifests itself as a purple to red aura surrounding the caster's legs.\n\nHistory\n\nRassimov used this spell to charge at Dante Vale and later to jump up onto the footbridge in the Professor's castle. [The Divine Comedy]\n\nOne of Tantras' students, Unnamed Orphan 003, used this spell to run across a canal in Venice, Italy. [Boys Will Be Seekers]\n\nMarduk used this spell outside the Fortress of Iron Will to chase Santiago up a cliff. [The Spiral War]\n\nInternational Names\n\nFrench: Tranche-course\nPortuguese: Pé Veloz, Velocidade Cortante","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox_spell\n| image = File:S2E36_Spiral_Student_Cutrace.png\n| aura  = Red\n| class = Mobility\n| users = [[Harrison Fears]]<br>[[Marduk]]<br>[[Rassimov]] <br> [[Silent Soldiers]]<br>[[Unnamed Orphan 003]]\n| first = \"[[The Divine Comedy]]\"\n}}\n'''Cutrace''' is a basic spell used by the [[Blood Spiral]] and is comparable to the [[Hyperstride]] spell. This spell increases the caster's speed and agility, permitting quick escape, sudden strikes during combat, and an increased jump distance. The spell manifests itself as a purple to red aura surrounding the caster's legs.\n\n== History ==\n[[Rassimov]] used this spell to charge at [[Dante Vale]] and later to jump up onto the footbridge in [[the Professor's castle]]. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}\n\nOne of [[Tantras]]' students, [[Unnamed Orphan 003]], used this spell to run across a canal in [[Venice, Italy]]. {{source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}\n\nMarduk used this spell outside the [[Fortress of Iron Will]] to chase [[Santiago]] up a cliff. {{source|The Spiral War}}\n\n{{Clear}}\n==International Names==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Tranche-course\n|POR=Pé Veloz, Velocidade Cortante}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Mobility spells]]\n[[Category:Red-aura spells]]","categories":["Blood Spiral magic","Magic","Mobility spells","Red-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:4446","status":"resolved","target_title":"Harrison Fears","label":"Harrison Fears","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Harrison_Fears","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4446"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:4648","status":"resolved","target_title":"Marduk","label":"Marduk","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Marduk","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4648"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2090","status":"resolved","target_title":"